  <item>
    <title>E11 关于感情｜大胆去爱 也勇敢放弃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6763d282ea209de6887d0b92</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6763d282ea209de6887d0b92</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Dec 2024 08:15:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hihihi来咯～</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制的时候我说我很久都没有心动的感觉了，可是此刻我突然觉得好像是我不再需要心动了。现在的我更加的理性，不会再像小时候一样给别人带上光环和滤镜，也不会再把自己渴望的爱投射在别人身上。理性的选择或许才是长大后感情的常态吧，没有心动，只有冷静的选择和交换。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> &nbsp;陈铭：各自拥有圆的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> &nbsp;到底如何开启一段亲密关系呀！好难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> &nbsp;联谊二三事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> &nbsp;因为喜欢的男嘉宾受欢迎而胆怯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> &nbsp;女生为什么不能是普信女？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我的心死掉了 都不会心动了（哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;原来在不知不觉中我已经成为一个圆了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;三十岁计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;理想型大公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;能不能接受最雷的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> &nbsp;突然有些佩服all in 的程莉莎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> &nbsp;打不赢就跑吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不要因为想要忘掉就草率地进入下一段感情 也不要把某段感情当成永远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> &nbsp;要改变！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> &nbsp;这和冷暴力有什么区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> &nbsp;不给答案其实就已经给了答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> &nbsp;人会越活越固执</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> &nbsp;及时止损 不做退让和忍让的那一个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> &nbsp;失恋也能让人成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;让那些没用的NPC在你的剧本里快点杀青吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家：收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《太聪明 》-by 陈绮贞</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq5o8uKNOnjYKSoNQ0Dqae_X5L21.m4a" length="45689328" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcYIPXNRAFI_rcM_4EkJuheVXrI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E10 规划精力｜别学一只蝉 只把生命留在某个夏天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674061098d1233fb0d3a25fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674061098d1233fb0d3a25fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Nov 2024 10:57:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hihihi～休假很久的吉吉回来啦，这一期邀请了我的同门好友悄悄，我们来聊聊工作后的一些感悟，希望大家收听愉快^_^</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> &nbsp;珍惜每一个珍贵的迷茫时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 真正的心理老师的生活还是有一点点差别的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 惊！某位刚拿驾照的新司机竟然向驾照已拿七年鄙人炫耀～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 驾校，一个巨大的应试机制。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 在生活中也非常需要公式的悄悄。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a> 请多一些有好的司机来治愈我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> 关于吉吉想做播客且想坚持下去的缘由。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 两个找不到导师的苦命娃最后成为了同门耶，感谢缘分。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 会和好朋友之间保持一定的边界感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 我的学生思维屡次被打碎又重建。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 和他人有一定的距离并不一定是坏事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 你只需要在意你在意的那部分就好了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 悄悄老师内耗故事两小则。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 有些人就是有边界感，有些人就是不停地冒犯你的边界感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> （悄悄金句）职场当中，证据很重要，留下证据也很重要，不留证据也很重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> Lang自己不内耗（悄别打我。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> 刻意说出别人的恶，然后隐藏自己的恶。人性如此。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> 人还是要敬畏因果。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a> 理智不了一点开始沉迷霸总小说了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 我好像一直都不是一个很努力的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 后劲足且缓慢的不停向前爬吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《Orange Memory》-by 罗言&amp;TT</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr2O4W6V8MIEtq9nBVRSxlkgu3m7.m4a" length="52111531" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcYIPXNRAFI_rcM_4EkJuheVXrI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E9 国庆特别期｜感谢我们身后这双稳定托举的大手</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fb781b6c7f8177864b850c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fb781b6c7f8177864b850c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 04:18:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好～国庆节快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近对一些宏观话题产生了好奇心（或许是两位主播年纪上来了…）放在节目前半部分进行了讨论，也是我们俩的初尝试。欢迎大家多多交流，共同进步😊对我们所处的时代和世界多些了解总没坏处，对吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 从西兰花涨价聊开去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 视频推荐：《变化中的世界秩序》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 《惊！GIGI或将弃文从武！》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 申论答案具像化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 受教育的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 生活中的顿悟时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 跳出历史周期率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> 金无赤足 人无完人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> “目光放长远一点，你就不伤心了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> 顺着金字塔往上爬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 你想「起高楼」还是「拼拼图」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 过去挺好 往后也不错 不过最重要的还是「活在当下」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 年轻就是不撞南墙不回头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 非主流时代鸡汤1：“自己选的路，跪着也要走完。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 非主流时代鸡汤2：“你只有很努力，才能显得毫不费力。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">31:21</a> 合理归因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 越在乎 越较真儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 谋定后动——谋到什么程度？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 给驴栓根胡萝卜（不是）给自己找点动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 她甚至没有考虑过失败(*°‿°*)！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> take a leap of faith</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 好想念校园啊T^T</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a> 生在红旗下 长在春风里 幸福地度过一生吧💗</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:《赛勒斯的爱》-by 张敬轩</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后祝祖国母亲生日快乐～！祝大家天天开心～！</span></p>]]></description>
