  <item>
    <title>E8 寻找balance | 世事无绝对 只有占比的权衡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f3d7b569b6a485e8d3f298</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3d7b569b6a485e8d3f298</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 09:28:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀，这期节目由吉吉和吉吉的两位好友「kk」和「星星」带来～（告假小雨：下期一定会回来的！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天进入下半程，天气转凉，大家记得加衣哟😊（好吃的柑橘橙柚也该上市了吧😋）</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝各位收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> &nbsp;社交媒体，kk的心情实录。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> &nbsp;星星：发送键就是一键清除键。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> &nbsp;工作的间隙学会见缝插针的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> &nbsp;当下只想做我认为我该做的事儿。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;能不能做好自己的事情啊不要让别人替你承担责任（😠。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a> &nbsp;被秩序感控制的两个人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;愿不愿意陪伴一个人成长（添加好友框吵架第一人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> &nbsp;万事都有缘法，做好自己该做的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> &nbsp;主动出击接元宝。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;唯一处理不好的情绪是懊恼，别给自己留遗憾。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;对抗反刍思维的方法：让自己累一点。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不是给大家散播焦虑哈，是环境的原因，不是我们自己的原因。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;承认自己是没有办法做到完美且不可替代的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;找工作是理想主义和现实主义的碰撞。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;会害怕一个人孤独终老吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;吉吉认为恋爱前需要做的准备工作。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;得出结论了：单身的一定比失业的多（笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;工作里有真正的朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;是的还是会跳脚，一个无法完全控制自己情绪的小女孩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不履行自己工作职责的人可太多了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2838">47:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;背后蛐蛐呢嘿嘿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：戒不掉 ——欧阳耀莹</span></p>]]></description>
