    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>碎片之长时间的独处后 我学会了呼吸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ed78c087a9242776af158b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ed78c087a9242776af158b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Sep 2024 13:29:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi朋友们，这是一小段吉吉的碎碎念，源自于某天突然发现的自己身上的一些变化。过去的一年有大半年都在和自己独处，我好像给自己建了一个小世界，里面只有我自己，在这个过程中没有外界的声音，只是和自己对话，但我感受到前所未有的平静。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后来读到博尔赫斯说：「追求平静在我看来是一种比追求幸福更合理的野心。」确实是，长大之后，花一段时间用来发呆、想一些有的没的、群里没有信息通知会令我非常安心，后来我意识到平静 才是最大的幸福。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltx4mTZ41J56i-LoKSiDpdPDi4xC.m4a" length="11076813" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:11:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcYIPXNRAFI_rcM_4EkJuheVXrI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E7 与情绪和解｜努力变成表面平静 但心有一片海的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d678fd5a91beebb364978c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d678fd5a91beebb364978c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Sep 2024 02:48:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi朋友们，这一期我们来聊一聊成年必修课之：情绪稳定。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 热嘴：跌跌撞撞的开始也是开始 没有白走的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 代际沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 大开大合的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 情绪脱敏与权衡利弊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 成为一片湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 青春期的自我中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> let’s 抻面～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> 「得意忘形」后干出的荒唐事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 「大悲时不发言 大怒时不争辩 大喜时不许诺」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 妈妈 愤怒是你的武器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 「己所不欲 勿施于人」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 沉住气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 等一等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 集体可以是拐杖，但总得学会自己走路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 尊重孩子的主体性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a> 「持续努力 随时放弃」——李诞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 理想主义去搞科研 我嘛 苟活就很开心了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 「不要把期望全部寄托在一个人身上」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 有人能温暖又臭又冷的石头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> 爱无差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 爱人如己 也要爱人先爱己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> &nbsp;先有自我认识 后有独立人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 摔倒之后骂骂咧咧 骂完了就站起来吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;———近期生活感悟———</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 喜欢给爸妈花钱，喜欢看爸妈花钱，搞钱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a> 干活儿嘛，干呗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 冷静之后还是要面对问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 成为乌龟</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：sence of alienation - drcchen 陈俊豪 收听愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llLEF5yFxKrFzUhSVGpJN-d59ZxK.m4a" length="46485844" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcYIPXNRAFI_rcM_4EkJuheVXrI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E6 关于长期主义｜哪有什么一蹴而就的事情 变美也是</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ca8863ead5fc37922f708e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ca8863ead5fc37922f708e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 01:26:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：吉吉/小雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hi朋友们！新的一期紧锣密鼓的来噜～这期库存记录于夏天的暴雨时节，身上感觉到又热又潮湿，但聊完后心里会很舒爽，希望你们听完也这么觉得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 见面热嘴环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 服美役🆚XX媛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 美商觉醒的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 对「花枝招展」的指责与维护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 吉吉眼中的「好看」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 「相由心生」：阅历丰富后 面对镜头也更平和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 小雨与体重搏斗的这些年——Round 1:尝到甜头的蜜月期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a> &nbsp;Round 2:重压之下气球一样的身体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> Round 3:“我背上了十字架”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a>运动带来的正反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> 自来卷超酷的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 还是那句话——不要逼死自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> 年纪大了 为了身体健康也要运动 : P</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> 有比减肥更重要的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 不要带着恨意出发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> 尊重差异 各美其美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> 吉吉美学原则：不费力&amp;自洽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 关于「买衣服」：直播间值得探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 关于「吃东西」和「运动」：选择适合自己的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> &nbsp;多试错 找到适合自己的风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a> 青春逼人的年纪怎么都好看啊T^T</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">29:36</a> 互评环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a> 让自己舒适、健康，好好照顾自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 讨厌自己会让妈妈很伤心哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 感受到目光汇聚时会产生「羞耻感」</span></p><span></span><p><span>———以下是题外话———</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> 网络有风险 上网需谨慎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">43:12</a> 竞技体育太燃了</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于我们开头提出的拒绝服美役VS拒绝化妆羞耻」的问题，当时没有讨论出答案，现在想补充说明一下：我们觉得，打不打扮这件事，自洽就好。喜欢素面朝天就素面朝天，喜欢精致就好好享受精致。每一个人，男孩，女孩，年轻的，年老的，都有按照自己的意愿生活的权利！</span></p><span></span><p><span>其次是临近结尾一些略显偏激的发言。因为我们成长的过程中见证了太多父职的缺失，所以对于父亲这一角色颇有微词。或许日后我们也会结婚生子，到时候也许会有不同的观点。本着「当时的想法当时记录」的原则，我们还是保留了这段对话。但同时，我们乐于接收不一样的观点，欢迎大家友好交流，帮助我们打破认知局限～</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：新生-ewonjin</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后 as always：自己给自己力量 💪</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqUG7ewjcxgxfFnzCRV0e3MhelCa.m4a" length="47195532" type="audio/mp4"/>
