  <item>
    <title>E5 向内求｜在巨大的P世界中 做锚定的自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c543a3db5e6d6bf9c98de1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c543a3db5e6d6bf9c98de1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Aug 2024 01:32:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi朋友们，我俩来啦！你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 吉吉工作的新变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> 否定之否定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 备考状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 没有一劳永逸的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 狭路相逢勇者胜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 题目的明枪易躲 生活的暗箭难防&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 透过考试看人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a> 生活是一场大型即兴表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 精力分配难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">32:44</a> 《头脑特工队》repo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2254">37:34</a> 《欢迎来到我身边》repo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 婚育话题返场&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">39:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> 独木难支 多给自己找几个支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2421">40:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a>听自己的话 走自己的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> 体面道别才不会留遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2845">47:25</a> 下次做个嘴甜心硬的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> 看见 表达 记录生活的证据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2896">48:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3102">51:42</a> &nbsp;不介入他人因果 “各人下雪 各人有各人的隐晦与皎洁”</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：SummerSweet(inst.)-Instrumental. 祝收听愉快～</span></p>]]></description>
