  <item>
    <title>E4 遗憾和错过常有｜但还是要去爱 去生活 去受伤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66adb72533ddcbb53cfc5d94</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66adb72533ddcbb53cfc5d94</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Aug 2024 04:50:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello大家好，这期邀请到了我们共同的小伙伴「一只牛」老师，一起来聊聊三位女生这些年的情感经历和感悟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历尚浅，我们自己也还有许多疑惑，说的不对的地方大家多多包涵，也欢迎大家在评论区交流自己的想法～</span></p><span></span><p><span>音量预警*：小雨不时会发出尖锐爆鸣，私密马赛，以后注意！本期你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:00:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">00:02:24</a> 三位女生的情感经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">00:02:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">00:03:26</a> 相亲好难之「长辈不知道我想要什么」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">00:03:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">00:05:10</a>三位女生对婚姻的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">00:05:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">00:06:36</a> 相亲好难之「资源池」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">00:06:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">00:07:52</a>「先搞好自己再搞对象」VS「无需过度准备」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">00:07:53</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">00:09:16</a> 「一只牛」老师的慷慨陈词：“我相信命运，我的命运就是根本找不到合适的男人”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">00:09:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">00:10:39</a> 你还试图了解男生吗？或者说男生可能被了解吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">00:10:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">00:11:57</a> &nbsp;(音量预警*1) 都这样了还抱有希望，怎么不算英雄主义呢？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">00:11:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">00:12:30</a> 听我的，每个女生都需要一个gay蜜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">00:14:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">00:16:14</a> 克服精神洁癖，人非圣贤孰能无过。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">00:16:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">00:19:50</a> 为颜值冲锋陷阵，不考虑现实的短暂快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">00:20:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a> 混沌未分，慢慢摸索着确认自己想要什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">00:24:59</a> 相亲好难之「不成熟的相亲对象让人疲惫」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">00:25:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">00:26:37</a> 做人留一线，日后好相见。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">00:26:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">00:27:00</a> 增强抵抗力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">00:27:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">00:28:51</a>（音量预警*2）讨厌利用别人的孤独趁虚而入的王八蛋！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">00:28:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">00:30:03</a> 不怕孤独&amp;知道自己想要什么的吉吉女王。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">00:30:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">00:33:00</a>（音量预警*3）没能同频的「错过」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">00:33:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">00:39:41</a> 当年没有大胆去爱最大的遗憾在于——亏待了无处安放情感的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">00:39:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">00:41:31</a>分开不是一个人的错，不要自责（我们女孩子就是太爱反思自己了）。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">00:41:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">00:45:00</a>畅想一下未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">00:45:01</a> -<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">00:45:26</a> 与他人深度交互的时候，更好地认识自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2727">00:45:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">00:45:44</a> 吉吉金句：你不需要抓住任何人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《Malibu Night》- by ira Khayz</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrdXT3DxgITxB5J63-kboSu1ePIu.m4a" length="47684502" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcYIPXNRAFI_rcM_4EkJuheVXrI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E3 打算想简单一点｜ 谁让我开心 我就和谁玩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6699e32e37236c546e397b45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6699e32e37236c546e397b45</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jul 2024 03:53:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：吉吉/小雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hi 朋友们，来晚啦。剪这期音频的时候距离录制已经过去了一个多月，这一个月发生了很多事情，所以回头听的时候会觉得一个月前的自己稍显稚嫩，但还是打算放出来，毕竟现在的我们是我们，过去的我们也是我们。本期你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 八字，中国人自己的mbti</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 植物大战僵尸限时返场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 到达目的地的三种路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 世外桃源不存在哦 不如先学着直面困难吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 面对大BOSS：“来吧！我不怕！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 空中有朵雨做的云～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 专注解决面前的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 理性之吉吉的黑鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 成为大人挺好的呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> 把问题拿出来讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 攻击性恒定 向外或向内</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 做自己永恒的战友 为自己战斗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 在实际生活中寻找自己的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 接纳全部的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> 吉吉本周的新变动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 外貌管理怎么不算重要呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> 鸡头还是凤尾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 两个世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> 尊重他人命运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 换个赛道 不要强求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 还是想寻找契合的灵魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a> 送给大家—不赶什么浪潮，也不搭什么船，我们自己有海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM:《学会独自面对》-by 嘿人李逵 &amp; KuiKui</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来会勤劳更新的，祝大家收听愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
