    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcYIPXNRAFI_rcM_4EkJuheVXrI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E2 多给自己点时间｜虽然身体被束缚 但思想永远自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666c359dc26e396a36d05ca2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666c359dc26e396a36d05ca2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 12:20:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：吉吉/小雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主要介绍了两个菜鸟新人的职场初体验，你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> &nbsp;未经审视的短择必然结束</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> &nbsp;沟通之必要：不要逃跑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> &nbsp;婉拒不合理要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> &nbsp;表达自己的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> &nbsp;坚持一下或许会柳暗花明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> &nbsp;喜欢女领导！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> &nbsp;树立自己的边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> &nbsp;“一只牛”老师的峥嵘岁月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> &nbsp;伯乐带来“被看到”的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> &nbsp;聊聊原生家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> “已读不回”的杀伤力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 暴露脆弱是一件危险的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 还有好朋友 还好有朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">24:46</a> 不要自闭 学会借力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 向上社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a> 大进步——停止盲目比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a> 人生需要抓大放小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a> 容貌焦虑在生存压力面前不值一提</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 不自由毋宁死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> 不是不辛苦 只是不觉得苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2196">36:36</a> 如果你想成为一个老板，就先假装自己是个老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 一两年也是一眨眼 溜走就溜走吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a> 多想办法少抱怨&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> “人永远有机会”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 不要着急 该是你的就是你的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 给J人一点小小的P人震撼...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">44:04</a> 根据目标作出挑选&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 祝大家都自由</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM:《December Composer》-by Vicky宣宣</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝各位：收听愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
