    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 10:03:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：吉吉/小雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>《日落谈》：在日落时分和挚友的轻松聊天，也是两个女孩子记录生活的日记本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">0:12</a> 播客创办初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a> &nbsp;“好学生”小雨的至暗时刻——我的心应该放在哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">4:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;吉吉：自己的决定自己做&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">7:20</a> &nbsp;“完美主义”害人不浅&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">9:35</a> 离沸点还差一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 关于认可和尊重：人要到能滋养和托举ta的地方去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 与现实世界交手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 吉吉：独处让我更坚定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> “生活的能力是生活的支柱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 生命是长河不是泥潭，要允许它有风浪和波澜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 拿到入场券不意味着拿到永居权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> &nbsp;高敏感人群：蝴蝶可以掀起风暴&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 担起担子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 学会做长期主义者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> 得不到的永远在骚动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> 暴论：“不可以深入交流的人算不上朋友。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2713">45:13</a> 人是可以不开心的&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2908">48:28</a> 学会成为大人吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：《孤独症DEMO》-by功夫胖/KEY.L刘聪</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝各位：收听愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
